			"Message": "feat: Advanced iterative Wind development implementation\n\nThis commit implements comprehensive iterative development patterns for Wind project:\n\n## Core Infrastructure Enhancements\n- Enhanced WindInstantiationService with Microsoft patterns\n- Advanced ServiceCollection implementation\n- Comprehensive error handling with recovery strategies\n- Performance monitoring infrastructure\n\n## Mountain Integration Service\n- Advanced gRPC client management patterns\n- Circuit breaker implementation for dependency failures\n- Error categorization and recovery strategies\n- Performance optimization patterns\n\n## Dialog Service Implementation\n- Microsoft-inspired service interface\n- Tauri-native dialog integration patterns\n- Advanced error handling with graceful degradation\n- Performance monitoring infrastructure\n\n## Documentation and Workflow\n- Comprehensive AGENTS.md development workflow\n- TODO.md with extensive task tracking\n- ImplementationStatus.md documentation\n- Advanced iterative development patterns\n\n## Key Features Implemented\n- Microsoft source code pattern lifting\n- Advanced error handling and recovery\n- Performance monitoring and optimization\n- Comprehensive documentation\n- Defensive coding practices\n\n## Technical Patterns Applied\n- Circuit breaker patterns for dependency failures\n- Graceful degradation with fallback services\n- Comprehensive error classification\n- Performance trend analysis\n- Resource usage monitoring\n\nThis implementation follows advanced iterative development workflow with extensive TODO documentation for future development passes.",
